    "detailed_description": "Travel Knight Adventures is a fast paced first-person shooter adventure game that takes you on a journey through the pre sci-fi age.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/7b79264d5e8dd451063e637a7e916634.poster.avif?t=1740099824\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/7b79264d5e8dd451063e637a7e916634.webm?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/7b79264d5e8dd451063e637a7e916634.mp4?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>You fall from the sky. Now it\u2019s time to explore various settlements, castles, and cities. Delve into mysterious dungeons and tombs filled with hidden treasures, traps, and riddles waiting to be solved.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/5ddcc2dead26aa575ff1b073a7c717e5.poster.avif?t=1740099824\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/5ddcc2dead26aa575ff1b073a7c717e5.webm?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/5ddcc2dead26aa575ff1b073a7c717e5.mp4?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>- More than 30 different weapons and magic items with unique mechanics<br>- Fast passed combat: mix between melee, throwing,  kick, guns and magic<br>- More than 50 hand crafted location - no procedurally generation<br>- Move between islands by top-down controlled ship or travel through land by top-down horse<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/a4c1bad6a642c204842719bf9a85a989.poster.avif?t=1740099824\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/a4c1bad6a642c204842719bf9a85a989.webm?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/a4c1bad6a642c204842719bf9a85a989.mp4?t=1740099824\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2644030/extras/60058cc202459722c78bac4a618d2930.avif?t=1740099824\" width=640 height=128 /></span>",
